     "texto": [
      "In Portugal, the weather bulletin talks about **temperatura máxima** and **temperatura mínima**.",
      "Temperatures are expressed in **graus** (degrees).",
      "Wind along the coast or the river can bring **rajadas fortes** (strong gusts).",
      "**Céu limpo** (clear sky), **nublado** (cloudy) or **chuva** (rain)."
